y).</p></ack><notes><p><xref ref-type="other" rid="sup1">Supplementary Information</xref> accompanies the paper on British Journal of Cancer website (<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="http://www.nature.com/bjc">http://www.nature.com/bjc</ext-link>)</p></notes><ref-list><ref id="bib1"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andren-Sandberg</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoem</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>B&#x000e4;ckman</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Other risk factors for pancreatic cancer: hormonal aspects</article-title><source>Ann Oncol</source><year>1999</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>131</fpage><lpage>135</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ann Oncol||10|131||bib1|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10436805</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib2"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aravin</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hannon</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brennecke</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Piwi-piRNA pathway provides an adaptive defense in the transposons arms race</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2007</year><volume>318</volume><fpage>761</fpage><lpage>764</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Science||318|761||bib2|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17975059</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib3"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burgemeister</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Gangnus</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Haar</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sch&#x000fc;tze</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Sauer</surname><given-names>U</given-nam